WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.978
Gently, very carefully, Dr. Dolittle walked over to the man.

2
00:00:05.979 --> 00:00:08.926
Just then his match went out again.

3
00:00:08.927 --> 00:00:12.436
"Get away from me, Ben Ali!" shouted the man.

4
00:00:12.437 --> 00:00:14.950
He thought it was a Barbary pirate.

5
00:00:14.951 --> 00:00:20.692
"Wait! I’m not Ben Ali!" Dr. Dolittle cried.

6
00:00:20.693 --> 00:00:24.398
"Who are you then?" asked the man with red hair.

7
00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:26.525
"My name is John Dolittle.

8
00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:30.799
And your nephew is with me," explained the doctor.

9
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.496
The man’s eyes filled with tears.

10
00:00:33.497 --> 00:00:34.949
"My dear nephew!

11
00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.344
Where is he?"

12
00:00:37.345 --> 00:00:40.382
Dr. Dolittle led the man out the hole.

13
00:00:40.383 --> 00:00:43.693
The boy was so happy to see his uncle.

14
00:00:43.694 --> 00:00:49.059
"Jip, I’m sorry I didn’t believe you," Gub-Gub cried.

15
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:52.822
"We’re all sorry!" cried Dab-Dab.

16
00:00:52.823 --> 00:00:59.874
"You’re the smartest dog in the world!" all the animals shouted.

17
00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:02.460
The uncle explained what had happened.

18
00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:06.610
"Ben Ali put me on this island because I didn’t want to be a pirate.

19
00:01:06.611 --> 00:01:08.707
I had no food or water.

20
00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:16.343
I lived on pickles and lemons for four days!"

21
00:01:16.344 --> 00:01:19.975
The man and his nephew lived in a fishing village.

22
00:01:19.976 --> 00:01:23.297
Dr. Dolittle sailed the ship toward their home.

23
00:01:23.298 --> 00:01:25.342
"There! There is my village!

24
00:01:25.343 --> 00:01:30.702
And up there is my house!" the man pointed excitedly.

25
00:01:30.703 --> 00:01:34.302
In the village, a woman spotted the red sails.

26
00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:36.049
"It’s the Barbary pirates!

27
00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:40.136
It’s Ben Ali! HELP!" she screamed.

28
00:01:40.137 --> 00:01:42.583
People came running toward the beach.

29
00:01:42.584 --> 00:01:46.528
It was indeed the Barbary ship.

30
00:01:46.529 --> 00:01:50.329
The people of the village were ready to fight the pirates.

31
00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:54.502
"Mommy! It’s me!" the little boy shouted.

32
00:01:54.503 --> 00:01:56.671
"What? Can it be?

33
00:01:56.672 --> 00:02:00.207
Oh, my baby!" cried the woman.

34
00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:08.546
Of course no pirates got off the shipㅡonly the boy, his uncle, Dr. Dolittle and his animals.

35
00:02:08.547 --> 00:02:12.112
The boy’s mother was the sister of the red-haired man.

36
00:02:12.113 --> 00:02:15.340
Dr. Dolittle and his animals stayed with them.

37
00:02:15.341 --> 00:02:17.680
The boy was her son.

38
00:02:17.681 --> 00:02:21.709
The boy and his uncle told the village people what had happened.

39
00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:27.149
"That’s how Dr. Dolittle got the Barbary ship!" said the boy.

40
00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:30.872
"Then where is Ben Ali now?" asked a villager.

41
00:02:30.873 --> 00:02:36.048
"He is on an island, where he is living as a farmer," replied the doctor.

42
00:02:36.049 --> 00:02:43.590
"Ben Ali, the great Barbary pirate, is now a farmer? Ha-ha-ha!

43
00:02:43.591 --> 00:02:53.957
Three cheers for Dr. Dolittle, who saved us from Ben Ali!" laughed the other village people.

44
00:02:53.958 --> 00:02:57.747
After two days, it was time to leave the village.

45
00:02:57.748 --> 00:03:00.777
The mayor gave Dr. Dolittle a gift.

46
00:03:00.778 --> 00:03:06.824
"To the brave man who rescued us from pirates, Dr. Dolittle," said the mayor.

47
00:03:06.825 --> 00:03:09.612
He handed the doctor a small box.

48
00:03:09.613 --> 00:03:14.540
Inside was a beautiful pearl and diamond watch.

49
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:20.292
"Oh, my! Thank you very much," Dr. Dolittle exclaimed.

50
00:03:20.293 --> 00:03:22.556
The mayor took another box.

51
00:03:22.557 --> 00:03:25.505
"Where is the dog?" he asked.

52
00:03:25.506 --> 00:03:28.464
Inside the box was a gold collar.

53
00:03:28.465 --> 00:03:34.268
"For the bravest dog in the world!" the mayor said.

54
00:03:34.269 --> 00:03:37.161
Everyone in the village waved good-bye.

55
00:03:37.162 --> 00:03:40.778
"Have a safe journey!" they shouted.

56
00:03:40.779 --> 00:03:47.307
They watched as the red sails disappeared across the waters.

